@startuml 14-system-host-capabilities
!pragma layout smetana
' SystemHost 的能力分组与依赖注入边界。
' 来源：GameProc/system_state_machine.h, eraengine.cpp::buildSystemHost

title SystemHost：能力分组与依赖注入

package "GameProc" {
  class SystemStateMachine {
    + setHost(host : SystemHost)
    + host() : SystemHost&
    + run() : ExecState
  }
  class ProcessState {
    + owns ExecState / SystemStateCode
    + currentMin
  }
  class EraParseTable
  class ScriptRunner
}

class SystemHost <<struct>> {
  .. all members are std::function ..
  + output callbacks
  + input callbacks
  + data callbacks
  + save callbacks
  + config callbacks
  + title callbacks
  + trainNames() : QStringList
}

package "output" {
  class OutputCapability <<nullable>> {
    + print / printC / printSingleLine
    + printTemporaryLine / printError
    + deleteLine / printBar / newLine
    + setAlignment / refreshStrings / printFlush
  }
}
package "input" {
  class InputCapability <<nullable>> {
    + waitInput()
    + readAnyKey()
    + mesSkip() : bool
    + lastLineIsTemporary() : bool
    + lastLineIsEmpty() : bool
  }
}
package "data" {
  class DataCapability <<nullable>> {
    + resetData()
    + addCharacterFromCsvNo(no)
    + defaultCharacter() : int
    + itemSales(no) : bool
    + buyItem(no) : bool
  }
}
package "save" {
  class SaveCapability <<nullable>> {
    + saveTo(index, text) : bool
    + loadFrom(index) : bool
    + checkData(index, message*) : bool
    + saveDataNos() : int
  }
}
package "config" {
  class ConfigCapability <<nullable>> {
    + autoSave() : bool
    + maxShopItem() : int
    + comAbleDefault() : int
    + printCPerLine() : int
    + compatiCallEvent() : bool
    + titleMenuString(index) : QString
  }
}
package "title" {
  class TitleCapability <<nullable>> {
    + scriptTitle / scriptVersionText
    + scriptAutherName / scriptYear
    + scriptDetail() : QString
    + scriptVersion() : qint64
    + setDefaultTitleVisible(bool)
    + trainNames() : QStringList
  }
}

SystemStateMachine o--> SystemHost : stores injected value
SystemStateMachine --> ProcessState : required constructor dependency
SystemStateMachine --> EraParseTable : optional table wiring
SystemStateMachine --> ScriptRunner : optional runner wiring
SystemHost ..> OutputCapability : groups callbacks
SystemHost ..> InputCapability : groups callbacks
SystemHost ..> DataCapability : groups callbacks
SystemHost ..> SaveCapability : groups callbacks
SystemHost ..> ConfigCapability : groups callbacks
SystemHost ..> TitleCapability : groups callbacks

note right of SystemStateMachine
  Required for a live control loop: ProcessState and the state-machine object.
  EraEngine normally injects parse table, runner, storage-related adapters and
  all available host callbacks. setHost() copies the value; it does not create
  the external subsystems.
end note

note bottom of SystemHost
  Every callback is nullable. Empty callback means the documented neutral/no-op
  behavior or a default scalar chosen by the handler. The state machine must
  therefore not assume ConsoleBackend, save files, CSV data, Config, or QML title
  objects exist. GUI and CLI/tests can inject different subsets.
end note

legend bottom
  Solid composition means SystemStateMachine stores the host value, not that it
  owns the capabilities. Dashed links are dependency-injection groups; ownership
  remains with EraEngine / GameView / data and configuration providers.
endlegend
@enduml
